I reckon 1, 2 & 3 (on one reading of 3) are the same. 2 is: there are
exactly two cookies eaten by me (in this particular event of eating).
3 is: there is exactly one eating (at this particular implicit time)
such that the eater is me and the eatee is two cookies.

